This is a mono repo that contains the following directories:
- application
    A nextJS application
- lab
    A Python scripts related to training models
- orchestrator
    A python pipelines that process data for the application
- shared


Important Rules:
- When importing packages, start the path relative to the each sub directories. 
    Bad: from lab/trains/rlvr_youtube_reviews/dataset.py import YouTubeReviewEnvGroupBuilder
    Good: from trains/rlvr_youtube_reviews/dataset.py import YouTubeReviewEnvGroupBuilder